An attribute line after a continuation marker attributes the attached block

```
- a
+
{.x}
> q
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote class="x"><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
+
> q
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
+
{.x}
para
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <p class="x">para</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
+
{.x}
> q
- c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote class="x"><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </li>
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```
